Implemented narrow fix in `src/cypher/cypher.c` and added regression tests in `tests/test_cypher.c`.

Root cause: any RHS variable forced WHERE deferral, so single-pattern queries with unbound RHS aliases skipped early filtering and could scan excessively. Fix now:
- defers only when WHERE references vars not bound by initial scan
- treats unbound RHS conjunctions as empty without scanning
- preserves property-to-property RHS comparisons

